{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56556","headline":"再歌 · 杨真人","name":"再歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阴中有阳，阳中有阴。\n既识砂中汞，须求铅里金。\n二味实天地之大宝，日月之至精。\n链得此者，下鬼不欺。\n（《大还丹照监》）（按：杨真人有可能爲前二人中之一人，亦可能爲同一人。\n因无他据，姑分列。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨真人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56556.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56556","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}